193 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 142 0 R
/E (The Wedding Hall Reservation System connects customers with hall managers on a platform built around booking wedding venues for specific event dates. Hall managers list their venues, complete with photos, pricing, facilities, and add-on services like catering and photography, pending administrative approval before going live. Customers browse and filter halls by location, date, capacity, and budget, then secure their chosen date with a non-refundable deposit \(the Araboon\), payable online or in cash. They can add supplementary services individually or as bundles, with the remaining balance due before the event. The platform allows date modifications within a set window \(with price adjustments\) or cancellations \(forfeiting the deposit\). After the event, customers can leave one rating and review per completed reservation, building each hall's reputation. The system is supported by customer support for inquiries and disputes, an administrator overseeing approvals and operations, and a finance manager tracking revenue and occupancy.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
